2026-10-26T13:58:01.0994102Z     [0m[36m│[0m
2026-10-26T13:58:01.0995155Z [0m[36m387[0m [0m[36m│[0m [0m[31mcrypto-bigint 0.5.5 registry+https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index[0m
2026-10-26T13:58:01.0996672Z     [0m[36m│[0m [0m[31m━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[0m [0m[31msecurity vulnerability detected[0m
2026-10-26T13:58:01.0997591Z     [0m[36m│[0m
2026-10-26T13:58:01.0998273Z     [0m[36m├[0m ID: RUSTSEC-2026-0387
2026-10-26T13:58:01.0999204Z     [0m[36m├[0m Advisory: https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2026-0387
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1000011Z     [0m[36m├[0m ## Summary
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1000590Z       
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1001277Z       Several operations intended to be constant-time could execute secret-dependent
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1002214Z       branches, depending on the compiler and target CPU. These include subtraction,
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1003059Z       zero counting, division, and Montgomery multiplication.
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1003610Z       
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1004161Z       Additionally, `UintRef` equality could terminate at the first unequal limb,
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1014573Z       and `BoxedMontyForm::invert` branched on whether an inverse exists.
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1015269Z       
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1015564Z       ## Impact
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1015925Z       
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1016461Z       Applications using affected operations on secret integers may leak information
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1017391Z       through timing or microarchitectural side channels. This includes information
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1018413Z       about intermediate arithmetic values, matching limbs, and invertibility.
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1019146Z       
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1019834Z       Such leakage could potentially enable recovery of cryptographic secrets.
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1021763Z       Practical exploitability depends on the downstream algorithm, compiler, target
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1022998Z       CPU, and an attacker's ability to observe the side channel.
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1023755Z       
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1024205Z       ## Resolution
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1024554Z       
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1025126Z       Upgrade to v0.7.6, which removes the identified branches, updates `ctutils` to
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1025782Z       include its constant-time fixes, and adds BINSEC-based regression checks using
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1026383Z       `cargo checkct` for arithmetic on multiple targets.
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1027383Z     [0m[36m├[0m Announcement: https://github.com/RustCrypto/crypto-bigint/pull/1365
2026-10-26T13:58:01.1028249Z     [0m[36m├[0m Solution: Upgrade to >=0.7.6 (try `cargo update -p crypto-bigint`)
